{{Headline|22|In Other News}}

*H.A.M. guards no longer allow unlimited numbers of coin pouches to stack in your Inventory.
*Pets are no longer welcome in the Nightmare’s arena. This does not prevent the Little Nightmare pet from spawning.
*Fixed an issue where players would be hit by Vespula’s melee attack if the portal died in Chambers of Xeric. Is anyone else getting déjà vu?
*The Agility route to the God Wars Dungeon is now marked with a shortcut icon.
*With the Hallowed Focus equipped, you will always attempt to cast the lowest level enchantment spell you have access to, since you’ll always succeed.
*Corrected a typo in the 'Shilo Village' quest.
*Raised the priority of various attack animations in the God Wars Dungeon to stop them being interrupted by defend animations.

